WEBVTT

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:20.370
So it doesn't show up, after all.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:25.450
Machines are no good, then.
Only living creatures can perceive them.

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:29.160
It seems I'll need humans to help me find them.

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:33.540
It's okay, don't worry.

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:37.870
The inhabitants of this
planet are all good people.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:42.540
I'm sure they'll find you.

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:30.000
This is a total Sunday.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.870
What makes it a "total" Sunday?
Can you explain?

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:37.330
What's your problem? I was only trying
to create a relaxing mood for you.

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:40.330
I don't need a relaxing mood.

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:42.450
Let's just get started.

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:48.660
Fine then. You're so impatient.

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:51.580
Whaaaa--!

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:52.750
Huh?

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:55.250
Why are you taking your clothes off?!

00:02:55.250 --> 00:03:00.450
Why? I'm about to get inside of you.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:02.080
You brought it up...

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:07.410
Why do I transform? And what
do the coins have to do with it?

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:10.120
You said you wanted to know.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:13.330
But if we're going to go down that path,

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:17.950
it means we might run into
another monster like that girl.

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:22.870
That's why we need to figure out exactly what

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:26.790
we're capable of together,
right now, while we can.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:30.200
If you're in, hurry up and
turn into the doggy, all right?

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:34.540
I mean, I will, but-- Doggy?

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:38.200
I'm still not sure why you
have to take your clothes off.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:40.160
Oh, this?

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:46.870
Honestly, Shuichi...
Your insides are stuffy as hell.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:51.290
You are a costume, after all.
If it was winter, it'd be nice and warm.

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:53.000
But right now it's summer.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.080
My underwear will get
totally drenched with sweat.

00:03:56.080 --> 00:04:00.750
And they'll get your slimy liquid all over them.

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:05.000
Yeah, but still,
getting inside of me naked is...

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:08.410
Don't worry about it!
We've already gone that far once, anyway.

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:10.410
What do you mean, "gone that far"?!

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:11.910
Let's become one.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:14.370
No!

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:20.000
Ugh, this is so lame.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.750
Th-That should be fine, right?

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:26.330
It's no problem if a swimsuit gets wet,
and it's easy to wash.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:29.750
I can't believe you'd rather have me
wear a school swimsuit than be naked.

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:31.200
I guess everyone has a fetish.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:33.620
That's not what this is about!

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:36.750
Okay, you ready?

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:38.500
Yeah...

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:45.830
Yep, there's still nothing there. Empty.

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:47.120
Oh.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:49.700
All right, I'm coming in.

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:56.790
It's okay, Shuichi.

00:04:56.790 --> 00:05:01.950
Just relax. I'll be gentle.

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:11.250
This feeling... It's the same as before.

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:16.950
I feel her inside of me so clearly.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:20.120
I can feel your anxiety.

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:22.750
It's just like it was my own body.

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:26.540
It's weird, but I feel like I could move
in ways I'd never be able to normally.

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:28.700
How is it for you?

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:31.330
Can you move by yourself?

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:33.120
Let me try.

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:41.160
Wow, my body is being moved! Gross.

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:43.620
It feels gross for me, too.

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:47.120
All right, Shuichi.
Can you grab that cup over there?

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:49.410
Yeah, no problem.

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:53.450
What the hell? My body won't--

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.330
I'm stopping you.

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:56.580
What?!

00:05:56.580 --> 00:06:01.330
It looks like I have more
control over movement than you.

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:04.540
Okay, I'll take the left hand,
you take the right,

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:07.870
and we'll see who can grab the cup the fastest.

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:09.910
Got it.

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:14.160
All right. Ready? Go!

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:15.750
Tickle tickle tickle!

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:16.830
What-- Clair, stop it, I--

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:18.330
Come on little guy, come on!

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:19.830
Oh, not there!

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:22.410
Here? How's here?

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.580
That's better.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:38.080
I knew you had a fetish, weirdo.

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:42.660
Shuichi, could you grab one
of the things in the fridge for me?

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:43.500
Okay.

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:47.580
Are you keeping these cold?

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:50.750
Huh? It's good during the summer.

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:58.910
All right, on to the next problem.

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:01.410
Problem?

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:04.910
My sister's school uniform is in there.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:08.830
I noticed when I first went inside of you--

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:11.410
You have a powerful sense of smell.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:14.450
Even in the dark,
I could tell where everything was;

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:17.250
the same as though it was right before my eyes.

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:20.330
Not only that, you can smell things
that are nowhere near you,

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:24.620
and distinguish smells
well enough to follow people.

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:29.040
With that nose, we can find my sister.

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:31.950
This might be my personal goal,

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:35.370
but seeing as how we have
no other information on these monsters,

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:42.080
finding her will be very valuable for you, too.

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:45.330
Clair's sister...

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:50.620
Clair said she killed their parents,
then disappeared.

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:55.500
Can I ask you something?

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:57.750
What?

00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:02.870
Did you actually see
your sister kill your parents?

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:07.040
I didn't. But...

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:14.830
Six months ago, I came home from school,
and our house was in shambles.

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:18.250
Standing there was a monster
that seemed like my sister.

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:23.040
Elena... Is that you?

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:26.160
That's right.

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:29.830
And next to her were my parents' corpses.

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:33.500
Isn't that enough circumstantial evidence?

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:40.660
I can sense Clair's feelings, if only slightly.

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:45.580
Is she feeling anxious? Lost?

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:49.200
Or does she still feel that her sister--

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:52.160
Shuichi.

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:57.700
I understand. That's right. I need to know...

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:04.830
Why I take this form.
Why that person attacked me.

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:11.580
And... The reason for the crime we committed.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:17.620
That smell...

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:28.450
The smell of blood!

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:31.870
And it's not just one or two people...

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:34.620
How many lives were lost?!

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:37.790
I've been naïve.

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:45.580
It doesn't matter whether Clair saw it or not.

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:48.120
It's completely clear.

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:51.120
The one that killed Clair's parents...

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:55.660
...was this beast!

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:02.290
Well, I thought I was prepared for this.

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:06.290
But it looks like the situation
is worse than I expected.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:13.080
Shuichi, what will you do?

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:17.250
Look for her. Together.

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:20.790
Hello, welcome.

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:25.040
Food, water. And a memory card.

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:28.790
Oh, right! Should we get a portable toilet?

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:31.410
I've never been on a stakeout
before, so I don't know.

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:33.580
I don't think we need that.

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:37.370
Well, in the worst case,
I can just use a plastic bottle.

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:42.830
You think two per person is enough?

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:48.080
What?!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.410
Oh, uh... Nothing.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:53.870
Thank you.

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:55.660
Would you like me to heat this up?

00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:57.950
Uh, yeah, please.

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:02.120
Can you heat that up too?
Open it up first though, please.

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:04.500
All right.

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:06.660
You said you liked it cold earlier.

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:10.160
The maple flavor is better when you heat it up.

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:19.790
Aren't you going to eat?

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:22.330
That smell, it's still...

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:25.620
But we can't do our stakeout if you don't eat.

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:28.120
Yeah, I guess.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.910
Honestly though, I'm surprised.

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:35.660
When you smelled
my sister's scent, even I felt fear--

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:39.370
But you still said you wanted
to look for her, together.

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:42.040
Are you trying to say that's not like me?

00:11:42.040 --> 00:11:46.120
Not at all. It was cool of you.

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:49.910
Clair.

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:51.580
What?

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:55.950
What are you planning
to do if we find your sister?

00:11:57.080 --> 00:12:02.870
Hmm. I just want to ask her...

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:10.660
Why she turned into a monster.
Why she killed our mom and dad.

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:12.330
And...

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.950
And?

00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:17.580
Never mind. Nothing.

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:20.750
What about you? What's your family like?

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:25.700
My family? I guess we don't
spend a lot of time together.

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:29.950
My parents are always working
and aren't home much.

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:32.700
And I was also sent to cram school.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:36.700
Still, we're pretty much normal...

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:40.580
So I'd like to get tangled up
in all this as little as possible.

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:41.700
Oh.

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:46.040
Oh!

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:48.370
What is it?

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:51.540
Oh... Nothing.

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:00.660
Well, this is the third day.

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:06.040
Lots of people use this station,
and my sister's school is nearby, but...

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:08.700
We've picked up nothing so far.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:10.910
Maybe my intuition was off.

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:13.330
Shuichi, give me some water!

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:15.750
We're out.

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:22.370
I suspect my sister is still in this town.

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:25.700
She might be a beast,
but it's still hard for a high schooler

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:29.000
to live alone in a town
where she doesn't know anyone.

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:31.160
You think someone is helping her?

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:33.660
That's my guess.

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:37.120
But if someone has been in contact with her,

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:39.870
that person should have her scent on them.

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:44.660
And if the scent is there,
your nose should pick it up. Right?

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:48.290
That's right. I've got to find it.

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:52.700
This is the only clue we have
that might reveal my secret.

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:57.870
Even if we are after a beast...

00:13:58.580 --> 00:13:59.950
Yes...

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:04.370
I will find her!

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:11.120
That's right! We'll get that slut together!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:13.330
What?! Is your sister a slut?

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:16.750
Huh? Well, I don't actually know.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.040
By the way, I'm a virgin!

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.950
I wasn't asking!

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:24.830
Well, I guess we should wrap it up.

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:28.160
Want to try looking at the mall tomorrow?

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:30.330
There are a lot of people there, too.

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:31.870
The mall, huh?

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:33.080
What is it?

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:37.660
Nothing. I just remembered there's
a movie playing that I want to see.

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:40.370
Sorry, it's not important.

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:41.910
We've got other things to think about.

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:47.410
Let's go. I don't want
to see a scary movie, though.

00:14:47.410 --> 00:14:50.950
I'm not good with scary movies.

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:57.160
Are you sure you want to go?

00:14:57.160 --> 00:15:00.290
We need some time to relax, too.

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:17.870
What happened? You transformed out of nowhere!

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:21.160
Someone's here.

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:28.870
So, you found someone who smells
like my sister. Is it a boy? A girl?

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:32.870
A girl. On the platform.

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:44.040
If it's a girl, it must be one of her classmates.

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.540
Not there.

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:50.040
What is this smell?

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:55.290
Even from this far away... Just breathing in...

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:57.410
Seems to weigh me down...

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:13.290
No good, Shuichi.

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:16.950
That's not my sister's classmate.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:19.830
That...

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:21.950
Is my sister herself.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:28.660
That... is Clair's sister?!

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:30.790
Let's go, Shuichi.

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:36.000
Hang on, Clair! What are we going to do?

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:39.790
Isn't it obvious? We're going to capture her.

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:41.200
Capture her?

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:45.040
First, we'll shoot her
with your gun, so she can't move.

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:47.330
Shoot her? Just like that?

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:52.620
Shuichi. She's killed many people.

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:54.540
She's a murderous demon.

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:56.910
But she's your sister!

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:58.250
So what?

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:03.370
So... Let me do it, alone!

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:04.500
No.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:05.620
What?!

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:09.790
Did you forget? I thought I told you...

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:15.120
We two are one.

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:23.830
Okay, Shuichi. We've only got one chance.

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:27.910
Clair... Are you sure
you can't just talk to her?

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:29.330
You two are sisters!

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:33.370
Talk to the person who killed our parents?

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:37.120
We'll aim for her legs. I'll fire the gun.

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:39.200
Huh?

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:43.370
After she goes down, hit her and knock her out.

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:46.000
Then we'll run off with her.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.500
How...?

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:52.120
How can she stay so calm?

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:56.540
She's about to meet the person
who killed her parents...

00:17:56.540 --> 00:18:00.540
About to shoot her own sister!

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:06.160
I don't feel any emotion coming from her.

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:07.500
She's erased them...

00:18:14.580 --> 00:18:16.000
Completely...

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:18.200
Erased all her feelings!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:24.250
No!

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:46.080
I can't move.

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:49.120
She's touching me... I can feel it...

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:52.620
I am nothing compared to her!

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:57.330
I can't believe you'd just shoot me like that.

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:59.370
No! She'll kill--

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:04.410
Oh... It's... I'm sorry.

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:09.330
I'm not used to this. So... You see...

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:16.330
Sorry... I need time to think...

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:21.450
Oh no, what should I do here?!
What should I talk about?!

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:24.250
Oh god! He can totally tell
I have communication problems!

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:25.830
What should I do?!

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:28.410
Wh-What the hell is with her?

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:32.580
I-It's okay. I understand.

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:35.410
You've come to kill me, haven't you?

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:39.250
Um, but, would you mind
if we do it somewhere else?

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:43.080
You know, somewhere it
won't bother other people?

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:53.620
What the hell is with her?

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:58.200
She's nothing like the picture,
or Clair's description.

00:19:58.200 --> 00:20:01.750
Is she really a murderous demon?

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:09.040
But... How did you find me?

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:12.330
Did someone tell you?

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:16.500
Oh, I'm sorry!
It's nothing for you to worry about.

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:19.910
I'm talking too much again.

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:22.700
I feel like I can talk to her.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:26.870
She's not attacking us
like the last girl we faced.

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:33.000
We even fired a gun at her,
and she's still so reserved!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:40.660
I understand why you're
trying to kill me. Completely.

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:43.660
And I know who you are, too.

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:49.750
Yes. It's all my fault.

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:55.500
She noticed? She could tell
that I was inside of Shuichi?

00:20:55.500 --> 00:21:02.040
I was weak. And that's why
you got wrapped up in this.

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:09.950
That's why... I don't mind if you kill me.

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:13.950
I'm so sorry!

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:16.540
I'm sorry, Shuichi!

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:24.910
I'm the one who made you take that form.

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:31.250
What are you saying...?

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:43.250
Wait... That sounded...
That sounded like... a girl's voice.

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:51.580
Is there a girl inside of you right now?!

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:54.200
Filthy!

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:56.290
Disgusting!

00:21:56.910 --> 00:21:59.330
Get out of there!

00:22:03.910 --> 00:22:06.620
That place...

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:10.080
...belongs to me!

00:23:44.150 --> 00:23:47.030
"Episode 4: I Wish I Was Someone Else"
